{% doc %}
  blocks/_showcase-intro.liquid — private to `sections/testimonials-showcase.liquid`.

  The column the lanes run beside: the aggregate score, the claim, the line
  under it, and whatever the merchant puts below that.

  ## It is a static block, so it cannot be dragged into a lane

  `sections/testimonials-showcase.liquid` renders it through
  `{% content_for 'block', type: '_showcase-intro', id: 'showcase-intro' %}`,
  the same mechanism `sections/feature-cards.liquid` uses for its heading
  cluster and `sections/testimonials.liquid` uses for its panel. A merchant
  editing it on the canvas cannot reorder it among the reviews, cannot delete it
  by accident, and cannot end up with two.

  ## The score row is drawn here rather than by `blocks/rating-badge.liquid`

  That block exists and does very nearly this — five stars, a score, a caption —
  and it draws its stars as a clipped overlay on outlined glyphs. The design
  here is five filled chips, which is a different shape, not a different colour:
  a chip is a square with a star knocked out of it, and there is no setting on
  the badge that turns one into the other.

  The number is typed, not fetched, for the same reason it is on that block:
  there is no product here to read a rating off. And for the same reason it
  emits **no structured data** — a figure a store typed into a text field is not
  evidence, and marking it up as `AggregateRating` is the fastest route to a
  manual action from Google.

  ## The buttons are blocks, the words are settings

  A heading and a line of supporting copy are what every one of these columns
  has. What goes under them is not: two buttons here, a logo row somewhere else,
  a trust badge on a third store. So the copy is settings and the rest is
  `@theme` blocks the merchant adds — the theme's own Buttons block is what the
  preset ships with, so the calls to action are the same element, with the same
  hover, as every other button in the store.

  ## The column paints its own text, and takes no scheme

  It sits inside the section's scheme and inherits from it. Only the pieces the
  design tints differently — the score, the caption, the heading — have their
  own colours, and each falls back to `inherit` so a merchant who recolours the
  section recolours this with it.
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign s = block.settings

  assign align = s.alignment | default: 'center'
  assign align_mobile = s.alignment_mobile | default: align
  assign gap = s.gap | default: 16 | plus: 0
  assign width = s.width | default: 0 | plus: 0

  comment
    ---- the score row ----

    `rating_max` chips are drawn and `rating` of them are filled. Both are
    coerced before they are compared: an unset select is nil in Shopify and
    Undefined elsewhere, and `nil > 0` is a type error in the second one.
  endcomment
  assign show_rating = s.show_rating
  if show_rating == nil
    assign show_rating = true
  endif

  assign rating_max = s.rating_max | default: 5 | plus: 0
  assign rating_filled = s.rating_filled | default: 5 | plus: 0
  if rating_filled > rating_max
    assign rating_filled = rating_max
  endif

  assign chip_size = s.chip_size | default: 19 | plus: 0
  assign chip_glyph = chip_size | times: 0.62 | round
  if chip_glyph < 8
    assign chip_glyph = 8
  endif

  comment
    The whole row carries one accessible name — "Rated 4.9 out of 5" — because
    five chips read out one at a time is five identical words with no number
    attached. The score beside them is then `aria-hidden`, or it would be said
    twice.
  endcomment
  assign score = s.score | default: ''
  assign rating_label = 'products.product.rating_html' | t: rating: rating_filled, max: rating_max
-%}

{%- capture intro_style -%}
  {%- render 'spacing', block: s, declarations: true -%}
  --sv-intro-align: {{ align }};
  --sv-intro-align-mobile: {{ align_mobile }};
  --sv-intro-gap: {{ gap }}px;
  --sv-chip-size: {{ chip_size }}px;
  --sv-chip-radius: {{ s.chip_radius | default: 2 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-chip-gap: {{ s.chip_gap | default: 8 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-score-size: {{ s.score_size | default: 18 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-caption-size: {{ s.caption_size | default: 15 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-intro-heading-size: {{ s.heading_size | default: 44 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-intro-heading-size-mobile: {{ s.heading_size_mobile | default: 30 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-intro-text-size: {{ s.text_size | default: 16 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-intro-actions-gap: {{ s.actions_gap | default: 12 | plus: 0 }}px;
  --sv-intro-actions-space: {{ s.actions_space | default: 36 | plus: 0 }}px;
  {%- if width > 0 -%}
    --sv-intro-width: {{ width }}px;
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.chip_color != blank -%}
    --sv-chip-background: {{ s.chip_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.chip_star_color != blank -%}
    --sv-chip-star: {{ s.chip_star_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.chip_empty_color != blank -%}
    --sv-chip-empty: {{ s.chip_empty_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.score_color != blank -%}
    --sv-score-color: {{ s.score_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.caption_color != blank -%}
    --sv-caption-color: {{ s.caption_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.heading_color != blank -%}
    --sv-intro-heading-color: {{ s.heading_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if s.text_color != blank -%}
    --sv-intro-text-color: {{ s.text_color }};
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

<div
  class="showcase-intro"
  data-block-spacing
  style="{{ intro_style | strip_newlines | strip }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- if show_rating and rating_max > 0 -%}
    <div class="showcase-intro__score">
      <span class="showcase-intro__chips" role="img" aria-label="{{ rating_label | strip_html | escape }}">
        {%- for index in (1..rating_max) -%}
          {%- if index <= rating_filled -%}
            <span class="showcase-intro__chip" aria-hidden="true">
              {% render 'icon', icon: 'star', size: chip_glyph, class: 'showcase-intro__chip-star' %}
            </span>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="showcase-intro__chip showcase-intro__chip--empty" aria-hidden="true">
              {% render 'icon', icon: 'star', size: chip_glyph, class: 'showcase-intro__chip-star' %}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </span>

      {%- if score != '' -%}
        <span class="showcase-intro__score-value" aria-hidden="true">{{ score | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.caption != blank -%}
    <p class="showcase-intro__caption">{{ s.caption }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.heading != blank -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      An `<h2>`. This column is the section's heading — there is no separate
      header cluster above it, the way `sections/testimonials.liquid` has one —
      so this is the line the page outline should carry.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <h2 class="showcase-intro__heading">{{ s.heading }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.text != blank -%}
    <div class="showcase-intro__text rte">{{ s.text }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Whatever the merchant adds under the copy. The preset ships the theme's
    Buttons block here, so the two calls to action are ordinary theme buttons
    rather than a pair this file draws and nothing else in the store matches.

    Rendered inside a wrapper rather than as bare children so the gap between
    the copy and the buttons is one setting, and so an empty list collapses
    instead of leaving a gap behind it — `base.css` hides the row when it has no
    children.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="showcase-intro__actions">
    {% content_for 'blocks' %}
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Every setting below is a control a merchant reaches in the editor, and the
  schema is one element's styling surface: splitting it to get under Theme
  Check's count of 40 would split the thing the settings style.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% # theme-check-disable ExcessiveSettingsCount %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.name",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@theme"
    },
    {
      "type": "@app"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_rating",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.show_rating.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "rating_max",
      "label": "t:blocks.rating_badge.settings.rating_max.label",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 5,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "rating_filled",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.rating_filled.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.rating_filled.info",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 5,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "score",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.score.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.score.info",
      "default": "4.9/5.00",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "caption",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.caption.label",
      "default": "Based on 30,000+ verified reviewers"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:shared.heading.label",
      "default": "Real Customers, Real Results. Proven and Approved."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:shared.text.label",
      "default": "<p>Genuine experiences from our community. No paid actors, just honest health transformations.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.headers.layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "alignment",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.label",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__1.label" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__2.label" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__3.label" }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "alignment_mobile",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.alignment_mobile.label",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__1.label" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__2.label" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.settings.alignment.options__3.label" }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "width",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.width.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.width.info",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 720,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:shared.gap.label",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "actions_space",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.actions_space.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.actions_space.info",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 36
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "actions_gap",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.actions_gap.label",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:shared.appearance.header"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "chip_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_size.label",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 19,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "chip_radius",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_radius.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_radius.info",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 2,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "chip_gap",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_gap.label",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "chip_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_color.label",
      "default": "#F9F871",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "chip_star_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_star_color.label",
      "default": "#0F2E2F",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "chip_empty_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_empty_color.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.chip_empty_color.info",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "score_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.score_size.label",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 18,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "score_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.score_color.label",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "caption_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.caption_size.label",
      "min": 11,
      "max": 28,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 15
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "caption_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.caption_color.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.heading_size.label",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 44
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_size_mobile",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.heading_size_mobile.label",
      "min": 18,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.heading_color.label",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "text_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.text_size.label",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 28,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.showcase_intro.settings.text_color.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:shared.spacing.block_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "padding_device",
      "label": "t:shared.spacing.devices.label",
      "options": [
        { "value": "desktop", "label": "t:shared.spacing.devices.options__1.label" },
        { "value": "mobile", "label": "t:shared.spacing.devices.options__2.label" }
      ],
      "default": "desktop"
    },
    {
